{"id":"n88090-1-8","stage":4,"title":"후속 · 后续","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88090-1-8-1","ko":"그 프로그램의 진행자가 건강이 나빠져서 그만둔대.","zh":"听说那个节目的主持人因为健康原因辞职了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"프로그램의","meaning":"节目，节目单","explanation":"프로그램：节目，节目单；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"2","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"프로그램의","audio":"/audio/7e0e5c6799ac11f8d00f.mp3"}},{"text":"진행자가","meaning":"主持人","explanation":"진행자：主持人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"진행자","audio":"/audio/78f98e56e0f2ccfd13c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29013","senseId":"1","lemma":"진행자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진행자가","audio":"/audio/bb815ab11ddd267a0e24.mp3"}},{"text":"건강이","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강이","audio":"/audio/533ba04e9890ae84a01b.mp3"}},{"text":"나빠져서","meaning":"有害，不好；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"나쁘다：有害，不好；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"4","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나빠져서","audio":"/audio/0625a04bac15b8ca063b.mp3"}}